Feature set at this version:
  - MQTT monitor + control (pause/resume/stop/light/start-print)
  - Per-model camera relay (RTSPS :322 for X1C/H2D, chamber :6000 for A1)
  - FTPS SD listing + upload, passive SSDP discovery
  - Demo mode (server.py --demo)
  - In-app Technical Archive at /docs (4 pages)
  - PDF manual (build_manual.py -> static/docs/LabConsole-Manual.pdf)
  - ERROR state wording + flashing red bezel; white LIVE camera tag

If any of the above is missing from your working tree, you have an outdated
copy. See the FILE MANIFEST section of CLAUDE.md to verify.
